  fhir:Questionnaire.description [ fhir:value "Short screening for emotional burden and depressive disorders (Whooley Questions / PHQ-2 Yes/No version) as referenced in the Nationale VersorgungsLeitlinie (NVL) Depression (AWMF nvl-005, https://register.awmf.org/de/leitlinien/detail/nvl-005). Reference period: last month (deviating from the standard PHQ-2 period of two weeks). When both questions are answered 'Yes', the instrument identifies depressive disorders with a sensitivity of 96% and a specificity of 57%."] ;
